  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Not reflexive: *relajar* means to relax someone or something else (a muscle, a rule, another person). The reflexive form *relajarse* (\"to relax oneself / calm down\") already exists as a separate verb file.",
    "*El masaje relaja los músculos de la espalda.* (\"The massage relaxes the back muscles.\")",
    "*La música relajó a los niños antes de dormir.* (\"The music relaxed the kids before bed.\")",
    "Related: *relajarse* (reflexive, \"to relax oneself\"), *relajado/a* (relaxed, adjective), *la relajación* (relaxation)."
  ],
